{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"2":{"eng-name":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat)","ara-name":"كتاب الصلاة"}},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":391,"hadithnumber_last":1160,"arabicnumber_first":391,"arabicnumber_last":1160}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":995,"arabicnumber":995,"text":"Rapporté par Abdullah ibn Mas'ud رضي الله عنه : Le Prophète ﷺ, pendant les deux premières unités de prière, priait comme s’il était assis sur des pierres brûlantes. Le narrateur Shu'bah a dit : « Nous avons dit : Jusqu’à ce qu’il (le Prophète) se lève. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":606},"chapter":{"id":190,"ara-name":"باب فِي تَخْفِيفِ الْقُعُودِ","eng-name":"Shortening The Sitting","isFirstHadith":true}}]}